<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AprovaCred | Crédito e Empréstimo Rápido</title>
<meta name="description" content="Simule seu empréstimo, faça o cadastro online e receba o retorno de um consultor. Crédito pessoal, consignado, com garantia e para negativados.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --azul:#0b3d91;--azul-2:#1456c8;--azul-escuro:#061f52;
  --verde:#16b364;--verde-2:#0e9b53;--verde-claro:#e6f8ef;
  --bg:#f5f8fd;--texto:#14203a;--cinza:#5a6780;--linha:#e2e8f3;--branco:#fff;
  --raio:20px;--sombra:0 10px 30px rgba(11,61,145,.10);--sombra-g:0 24px 60px rgba(6,31,82,.28);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans','Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--texto);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
button{font-family:inherit}
.container{width:100%;max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
svg{display:block}

/* ---------- HEADER ---------- */
header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;transition:.3s}
header .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px;transition:.3s}
header.scrolled{background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(6,31,82,.08)}
header.scrolled .nav{height:62px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;color:#fff;transition:.3s}
.logo i{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--verde),#4be09a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(22,179,100,.45)}
.logo b{color:#5ee9a8}
header.scrolled .logo{color:var(--azul)}
header.scrolled .logo b{color:var(--verde)}
.menu{display:none;gap:28px;font-weight:600;font-size:.93rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)}
.menu a:hover{color:#fff}
header.scrolled .menu{color:var(--cinza)}
header.scrolled .menu a:hover{color:var(--azul)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--verde),var(--verde-2));color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:50px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;transition:.25s;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(22,179,100,.38)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(22,179,100,.5)}
.btn-sm{padding:10px 20px;font-size:.88rem}
.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.btn-block{width:100%}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{position:relative;background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 85% -10%,#2a6be0 0%,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(800px 500px at -10% 110%,#0f9d6a 0%,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(165deg,var(--azul) 0%,var(--azul-escuro) 100%);color:#fff;padding:120px 0 90px;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before,.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;filter:blur(2px)}
.hero::before{width:380px;height:380px;right:-120px;top:120px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.hero::after{width:220px;height:220px;left:-70px;bottom:40px;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.hero-grid{position:relative;display:grid;gap:44px;align-items:center;z-index:1}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:7px 15px;border-radius:50px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.pill span{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#5ee9a8;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(94,233,168,.7);animation:pulso 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulso{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(94,233,168,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(94,233,168,0)}}
.hero h1{font-size:2.35rem;line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:16px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5ee9a8,#b6ffd9);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero p.lead{font-size:1.08rem;opacity:.92;max-width:520px;margin-bottom:26px}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}
.link-sec{font-weight:700;color:#fff;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding-bottom:2px;font-size:.95rem}
.link-sec:hover{border-color:#5ee9a8}
.selos{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 22px;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.95}
.selos div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.selos svg{width:18px;height:18px;color:#5ee9a8}

/* ---------- SIMULADOR ---------- */
.sim{background:#fff;color:var(--texto);border-radius:24px;padding:26px 22px;box-shadow:var(--sombra-g);position:relative}
.sim-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.sim h2{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--azul)}
.sim .passo-tag{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--verde-2);background:var(--verde-claro);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:50px}
.tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px}
.tab{border:1.5px solid var(--linha);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 8px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--cinza);cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
.tab:hover{border-color:var(--azul-2);color:var(--azul)}
.tab.on{background:var(--azul);border-color:var(--azul);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(11,61,145,.3)}
.sim .rot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-weight:600;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--cinza);margin-bottom:2px}
.sim .valor{font-size:2.3rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--azul);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:100%;height:8px;border-radius:50px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--verde) var(--p,10%),#dde5f2 var(--p,10%));outline:none;margin:14px 0 6px}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--verde);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25);cursor:grab}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--verde);box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25);cursor:grab}
.limites{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--cinza);margin-bottom:16px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 18px}
.chip{flex:1 0 auto;min-width:52px;border:1.5px solid var(--linha);background:#fff;border-radius:50px;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--cinza);cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--verde)}
.chip.on{background:var(--verde-claro);border-color:var(--verde);color:var(--verde-2)}
.resultado{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f5ff,#eafaf2);border:1px solid var(--linha);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.resultado small{color:var(--cinza);font-weight:600}
.resultado strong{display:block;font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--verde-2);letter-spacing:-.01em}
.aviso{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--cinza);margin-top:12px;text-align:center;line-height:1.45}
.sim-garantia{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--cinza);margin-top:12px}
.sim-garantia svg{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--verde-2)}

/* ---------- SEÇÕES ---------- */
section{padding:78px 0}
.titulo{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 44px}
.titulo .sobre{display:inline-block;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--verde-2);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
.titulo h2{font-size:1.85rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:var(--azul);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.titulo p{color:var(--cinza);margin-top:10px}

/* Faixa de confiança */
.faixa{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linha);padding:26px 0}
.faixa-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.faixa-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--azul)}
.faixa-item i{flex:0 0 42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--verde-claro);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--verde-2)}
.faixa-item svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.faixa-item small{display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--cinza);font-size:.78rem}

/* Produtos */
.cards{display:grid;gap:18px}
.prod{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--raio);padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:var(--sombra);cursor:pointer;transition:.3s;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;width:100%}
.prod::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--azul-2),var(--verde));transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:.35s}
.prod:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:#cfe0ff;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(11,61,145,.16)}
.prod:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.prod .ic{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f0ff,#dff7ea);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--azul);margin-bottom:16px}
.prod .ic svg{width:28px;height:28px}
.prod h3{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--azul);margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:800}
.prod p{color:var(--cinza);font-size:.93rem;margin-bottom:16px}
.prod .go{font-weight:800;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--verde-2);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.prod .go svg{width:16px;height:16px;transition:.25s}
.prod:hover .go svg{transform:translateX(5px)}
.prod .etq{position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--verde-claro);color:var(--verde-2);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:50px}

/* Negativados */
.neg{padding-top:0}
.destaque{position:relative;display:grid;gap:26px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--azul),var(--azul-escuro));color:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:40px 26px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--sombra-g)}
.destaque::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-80px;top:-80px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(94,233,168,.3),transparent 70%)}
.destaque>*{position:relative;z-index:1}
.destaque .tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--verde);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;padding:5px 13px;border-radius:50px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:14px}
.destaque h2{font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.destaque p{opacity:.93;margin-bottom:18px}
.destaque ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px}
.destaque li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:.93rem}
.destaque li svg{flex:0 0 22px;width:22px;height:22px;color:#5ee9a8;margin-top:1px}
.destaque .aviso-neg{font-size:.76rem;opacity:.78;margin-top:14px}

/* Como funciona */
.passos{background:#fff}
.timeline{display:grid;gap:22px;position:relative;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.t-item{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--bg);border-radius:var(--raio);padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--linha);transition:.3s}
.t-item:hover{background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--sombra);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.t-num{flex:0 0 50px;height:50px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--azul-2),var(--azul));color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(11,61,145,.3)}
.t-item h3{color:var(--azul);font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:4px}
.t-item p{color:var(--cinza);font-size:.93rem}
.cta-meio{text-align:center;margin-top:38px}

/* Vantagens */
.vant{display:grid;gap:16px}
.vant div{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--raio);padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--sombra);display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}
.vant i{flex:0 0 46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--verde-claro);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--verde-2)}
.vant svg{width:24px;height:24px}
.vant h3{color:var(--azul);font-size:1.02rem;margin-bottom:3px}
.vant p{color:var(--cinza);font-size:.91rem}

/* FAQ */
.faq details{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(11,61,145,.06);border:1px solid var(--linha);overflow:hidden}
.faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--azul);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.faq summary::after{content:"+";font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1;color:var(--verde-2);transition:.25s;flex:0 0 auto}
.faq details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq details[open]{border-color:#cfe0ff}
.faq p{padding:0 22px 20px;color:var(--cinza);font-size:.94rem}

/* CTA final */
.cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--azul) 0%,var(--azul-escuro) 100%);color:#fff;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cta::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:-140px;width:520px;height:520px;margin-left:-260px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(22,179,100,.28),transparent 65%)}
.cta .container{position:relative}
.cta h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:10px}
.cta p{opacity:.92;margin-bottom:26px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

footer{background:#04163d;color:#aebbd6;padding:36px 0 90px;font-size:.84rem;text-align:center}
footer p{margin-bottom:8px}
footer strong{color:#fff}

/* Barra fixa mobile */
.barra{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;padding:10px 16px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));box-shadow:0 -6px 24px rgba(6,31,82,.18);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;transform:translateY(110%);transition:.35s}
.barra.show{transform:none}
.barra span{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--azul);line-height:1.25;flex:1}
.barra span small{display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--cinza)}
.barra .btn{padding:12px 22px;font-size:.92rem;white-space:nowrap}

/* Reveal */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.rv.d1{transition-delay:.1s}.rv.d2{transition-delay:.2s}.rv.d3{transition-delay:.3s}

@media(min-width:760px){
  .menu{display:flex}
  .hero{padding:150px 0 110px}
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr}
  .hero h1{font-size:3.3rem}
  .faixa-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .vant{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .destaque{grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;padding:52px 48px;align-items:center}
  .timeline{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .t-item{flex-direction:column}
  .titulo h2{font-size:2.3rem}
  .tabs{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  .barra{display:none}
  footer{padding-bottom:36px}
}
@media(min-width:1000px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.rv{opacity:1;transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header id="topo">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="#" class="logo">
      <i><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></i>
      <span>Aprova<b>Cred</b></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="menu">
      <a href="#produtos">Soluções</a>
      <a href="#como-funciona">Como funciona</a>
      <a href="#vantagens">Vantagens</a>
      <a href="#duvidas">Dúvidas</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#simulador" class="btn btn-sm">Simular agora</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<!-- HERO + SIMULADOR -->
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:90px">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="rv">
      <div class="pill"><span></span> Cadastro 100% online</div>
      <h1>Seu crédito <em>sem burocracia</em>, do jeito mais simples</h1>
      <p class="lead">Simule em segundos, faça seu cadastro online e receba o retorno de um consultor. Opções para quem precisa de dinheiro rápido, inclusive para negativados.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#simulador" class="btn">Quero simular agora
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#como-funciona" class="link-sec">Ver como funciona</a>
      </div>
      <div class="selos">
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Sem compromisso</div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Análise individual</div>
        <div><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>Dados protegidos</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sim rv d2" id="simulador">
      <div class="sim-top">
        <h2>Simule seu empréstimo</h2>
        <span class="passo-tag">Passo 1 de 3</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tabs" id="tabs">
        <button class="tab on" data-tipo="pessoal" type="button">Pessoal</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tipo="consignado" type="button">Consignado</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tipo="garantia" type="button">Com garantia</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tipo="negativados" type="button">Negativados</button>
      </div>

      <div class="rot"><span>De quanto você precisa?</span></div>
      <div class="valor" id="valorOut">R$ 5.000</div>
      <input type="range" id="valor" min="500" max="50000" step="500" value="5000" aria-label="Valor desejado">
      <div class="limites"><span>R$ 500</span><span>R$ 50.000</span></div>

      <div class="rot"><span>Em quantas parcelas?</span></div>
      <div class="chips" id="chips">
        <button class="chip" data-n="6" type="button">6x</button>
        <button class="chip on" data-n="12" type="button">12x</button>
        <button class="chip" data-n="24" type="button">24x</button>
        <button class="chip" data-n="36" type="button">36x</button>
        <button class="chip" data-n="48" type="button">48x</button>
      </div>

      <div class="resultado">
        <small>Parcela estimada</small>
        <strong id="parcelaOut">—</strong>
      </div>

      <a href="cadastro.html" class="btn btn-block" id="btnSim">Continuar meu pedido
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      <div class="sim-garantia">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 018 0v4"/></svg>
        Leva menos de 3 minutos • Seus dados protegidos
      </div>
      <p class="aviso">Simulação ilustrativa. Taxas, prazos e condições finais dependem de análise de crédito e aprovação.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAIXA -->
<div class="faixa">
  <div class="container faixa-grid">
    <div class="faixa-item rv"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="3"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></i><div>Tudo online<small>Do celular, sem filas</small></div></div>
    <div class="faixa-item rv d1"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></i><div>Processo ágil<small>Cadastro em poucos minutos</small></div></div>
    <div class="faixa-item rv d2"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c.6-3.4 3.2-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.9 2.1 6.5 5.5M17 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7M18.5 14.7c1.7.6 2.7 2.3 3 4.3"/></svg></i><div>Atendimento humano<small>Consultor dedicado ao seu caso</small></div></div>
    <div class="faixa-item rv d3"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.3 8-8 9-4.7-1-8-4.5-8-9V6l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></i><div>Dados seguros<small>Protegidos pela LGPD</small></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

